              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inɔ, bia mun ɛmɛ dääk kä rɔ̱ ce̱tnikɛ thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia jɛ cu ka̱n ala duŋdun kɛɛl kɛ jur tin cieŋ rɛydun, tɔ̱ ca gaat dap rɛydun tɔ̱. Bi yɛn kɛ ciɛŋ ala nɛy ti cieŋ kä I-thɛ-rɛl ɛmɛ. Kɛɛl kɛ yɛ bia kɛ moc kɛ mun mi la duŋdiɛn rɛy thukni duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram ɔ bi cieŋ rɛydun ɔ kä jur, bia jɛ dhil ka̱mɛ ala duŋdɛ, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
